WEBVTT

00:05:00.081 --> 00:05:01.231
(Smijeh)

00:05:03.072 --> 00:05:04.939
To je odabrala.

00:05:07.875 --> 00:05:09.412
Ne promatram dijete.

00:05:09.436 --> 00:05:11.680
Želi se igrati s mamom, zar ne?

00:05:11.704 --> 00:05:12.971
Odabrati sigurniji put.

00:05:13.736 --> 00:05:14.886
Okrenem se...

00:05:16.093 --> 00:05:17.760
(Smijeh)

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:19.984
Ni on ništa nije radio.

00:05:24.371 --> 00:05:25.903
Da, osjeća se nelagodno.

00:05:25.927 --> 00:05:26.934
(Smijeh)

00:05:26.958 --> 00:05:29.647
Svatko prepoznaje taj kriomični
pogled sa strane, zar ne?

00:05:29.807 --> 00:05:32.268
Treća verzija, dvoje promatrača,
jedan daljinski.